From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rui Figueira <rfigueira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 00:28:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Enable accent-color in the servo build

Same pattern as the @page size/page/orientation enablement: drop the
engine="gecko" gate so the servo feature set generates the longhand.
The embedder's form-control paint (checkbox, radio, range) reads it to
color the widgets like real browsers, instead of falling back to the
element's text color.
---
 properties/longhands.toml | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/properties/longhands.toml b/properties/longhands.toml
index 0e15437..733bc2f 100644
--- a/properties/longhands.toml
+++ b/properties/longhands.toml
@@ -132,7 +132,6 @@ affects = "layout"
 type = "ColorOrAuto"
 initial = "generics::color::ColorOrAuto::Auto"
 struct = "inherited_ui"
-engine = "gecko"
 spec = "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-ui-4/#widget-accent"
 ignored_when_colors_disabled = true
 affects = "paint"
